Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:15.95,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Hmm, how interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:16.97,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:18.33,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Are you an applicant, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you the saint of the Holy Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.18,0:00:28.67,main,REYES,0,0,0,,And what if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:31.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So you really are. Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:35.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're a light attribute, right? \NI've never met one before!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:37.80,main,REYES,0,0,0,,How dare you behave so familiarly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:41.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's the only attribute that \Nallows you to heal, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:43.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Incredible! I have so many questions!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.72,0:00:45.39,main,REYES,0,0,0,,If you're trying to hit on me, \Nthe answer is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:47.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please! Pretty please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:50.12,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Maybe over some sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:52.28,main,HANK,0,0,0,,He's quite a character.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:53.64,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:30.02,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE ADVANCED CLASS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.67,0:02:26.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:29.41,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear about light magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.41,0:02:31.46,main,REYES,0,0,0,,And what do you plan\N to do after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:35.17,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Light stands higher than the \Nmagic of other attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:38.84,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Can inferior magic learn \Nfrom superior magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:40.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:42.59,main,HANK,0,0,0,,There's no clear hierarchy in magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:46.94,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I'm not aware of this myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:51.60,main,REYES,0,0,0,,but I lack emotions \Ncompared to other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:56.84,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I think I'm speaking normally, \Nbut you may feel offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:02:58.65,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I wanted to let you know\Nthat in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:03:00.28,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Your emotions?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:02.58,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I'm a Hero's Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:03.91,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Hero's Scar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:06.41,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Like me, she carries the \NCurse of the Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:10.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The saint with light magic, \Nand a Hero's Scar on top of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.43,0:03:12.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Which makes you even more fascinating!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:14.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please, I want to hear more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:16.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Because it's fate that we met here today!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:19.01,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.01,0:03:21.68,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Hey! Save your flirting for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:23.82,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Professor Soff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:25.95,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:28.68,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,So strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:36.19,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Is this everyone, Ms. Sayfie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.19,0:03:37.19,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:40.30,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,My name is Soff Cricket.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:43.25,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,I am a professor here at \Nthe Dirashik School of Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:46.07,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,This is my assistant, Ms. Sayfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:47.50,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,I'm Sayfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:52.08,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,I'm not an official employee,\N but I'm like an associate professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:53.49,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:57.09,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,All four of you, congratulations \Non your enrollment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:01.56,main,HANK,0,0,0,,We passed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:03.29,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,But what about the exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:07.04,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,At this school, you can basically \Npass if you're a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.42,main,REYES,0,0,0,,That's not what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:10.72,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,We never announce that to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:13.85,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Sorcerers with crests \Nare rare and precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.92,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Why would we leave you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:18.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I studied so much for the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:20.69,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Of course you'll take the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:23.88,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,That's why we asked you four to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:27.74,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,There are three courses at \Nthe Dirashik School of Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:30.43,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,The First Level, \Nalso known as Fundamentals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.43,0:04:33.87,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,It's a class to learn the basics \Nof magic, as the name suggests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.18,0:04:36.43,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,The Second Level is \Ncalled Teacher-Assisted,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.43,0:04:39.68,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,and it's closer to how a class \Nis taught in a normal school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:41.87,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,This class has the most students.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:45.65,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,And the advanced Third Level class\N is also called Independent Research.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.05,0:04:48.44,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,They're usually not in their classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:49.90,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,They can choose what they want to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.90,0:04:54.52,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,what to learn, and study \Nit wherever they like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:59.63,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,You can choose to improve your \Nmagic skills or devise new spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:03.15,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Or write grimoires or \Ninvent new magic tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:08.37,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The advanced class. I get to research \Nwhat I want? That's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:12.85,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,But the advanced class is for \Nfostering the top-tier sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:16.00,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Getting into it and \Ngraduating won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:18.69,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,You four came with letters \Nof recommendation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:22.30,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,from your country or \Nyour masters of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.93,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,They think you have enough skill \Nto be in the advanced class.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:28.64,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,The exam for the advanced class?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.90,0:05:31.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So, what do you think we'll be tested on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:33.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm kind of excited, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:34.52,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:36.93,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,First is the practical skill test. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:37.39,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:38.14,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:38.61,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:39.52,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.09,0:05:43.69,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,One by one, step forward and tell \Nme your crest's attribute, its rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:46.16,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,and the number of spells you can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:47.13,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Hank Beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:47.78,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:50.99,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I'm Hank Beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:53.16,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I have a two-star fire crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.16,0:05:55.11,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I can use seven spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.11,0:05:57.53,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Show me your best spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.53,0:05:58.42,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:01.26,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Ka-ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:05.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:07.39,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Ka-ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:10.18,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Flame goes up along the magical \Npower that precedes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:12.60,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It's an elementary spell \Nthat's not too difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:15.10,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The magical power to determine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.41,0:06:18.98,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,the route seems more important \Nthan the flame itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:22.19,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The structure is simple, so its \Napplications are limitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:23.43,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Very informative.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:26.61,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Yes, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:29.35,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Your control is especially excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:33.85,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:34.99,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:38.67,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I'm Riyah Houghs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:40.88,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,My attribute is wind, and I'm a two-star.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:42.88,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I have eight spells I can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:45.23,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Eight at your age?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:46.51,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.84,0:06:49.11,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,I have a wind crest, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:51.39,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,It makes me want to root for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:53.81,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.21,0:06:57.39,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me, but please \Nkeep your distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.78,0:06:58.65,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:13.20,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It's so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.50,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Fu-garu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:23.88,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,An intermediate spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:25.38,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,This is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.38,0:07:27.71,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Fu-garu draws the magical power in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.71,0:07:31.25,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,to collect air and turns \Nit into wind to release it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.25,0:07:35.58,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It seems the intermediate magic \Nuses way more magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:37.14,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Well, not that I actually see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:41.45,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Quite different from the elementary \Nmagic. Very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:47.97,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I'm Reyes Saint-Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:50.52,main,REYES,0,0,0,,My attribute is three-star light.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:53.11,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I can use five spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.11,0:07:56.14,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Finally, a rare light sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.14,0:07:59.87,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,And three stars. Even more fascinating!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.15,0:08:05.00,main,REYES,0,0,0,,My best spell is healing magic,\N but no one is injured right now, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:08.50,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Ra-sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:12.19,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:15.64,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,You can't evade this unless \Nyou react before she casts it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.83,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I can't contain my curiosity!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.36,0:08:23.39,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Now, lastly, Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:24.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:31.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm Kunon Gurion, a two-star of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:33.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I have two spells I can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:35.90,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Two?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:37.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.47,0:08:40.04,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Elementary A-ori and A-rubu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:42.88,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Only two elementary spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:47.19,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Despite that, I've been told \Nto make your exam extra hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:48.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:51.17,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,I have two letters of \Nrecommendation under your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:54.18,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,One is from the Grand Master of \Nthe Royal Sorcerers of Hughlia,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:55.51,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Master Londimonde.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:57.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Grand Master Blue Cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.37,0:08:58.35,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Wait, who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:00.31,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,And another letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.31,0:09:02.98,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,the request to make your exam \Nchallenging, came from your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.98,0:09:04.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,My master?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:07.00,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Yes. Zeonly Finroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.39,main,HANK,0,0,0,,{\i1}The{\i0} Zeonly Finroll?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.39,0:09:12.61,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,He's the student of the \Nbest-selling sorcerer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.61,0:09:13.24,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:15.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You know my master?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.59,0:09:19.45,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Every sorcerer in education knows him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:21.74,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,And according to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:26.20,main - flashback,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,He'll complete any assignment \Nyou give, so make it extra hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:29.33,main - flashback,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I'll show you what my \Nstudent is capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:31.26,main - flashback,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Watch and be amazed, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:32.10,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,That's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:34.38,main - italics,HANK/RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's what he's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:35.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:38.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If my master insists, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:40.39,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,You'll do it? Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:44.05,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,I see your impudence comes from that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.05,0:09:46.21,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,And you're so audacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:48.77,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,I hate your pretentious calmness \Nand how flirty you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:50.97,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,You should keep that to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.97,0:09:52.36,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:57.25,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,The boy is supposed the masterpiece of \Nthat man who rarely acknowledges anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:10:01.16,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Let's give him the toughest \Nexam and send him back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:04.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Professor Sayfie, do you \Nhave history with my master?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.57,0:10:05.57,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,I do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:07.18,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Why would I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:09.04,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So you do...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:13.18,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Well then, let's begin Kunon \NGurion's practical skill test.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:15.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Thank you for the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.75,0:10:18.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hey, I'll give it my all, \Nso will you watch me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:20.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And maybe we can go somewhere \Ntogether afterwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:23.18,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,That's enough. No flirting, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:24.81,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Fu-ruguru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:36.62,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Try and hit me with your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.75,0:10:42.41,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Fu-ruguru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.65,0:10:46.01,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,An intermediate spell that creates \Na wall of wind around the caster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:48.66,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Amazing! It's a whirlpool \Nof magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.66,0:10:50.88,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Water will be repelled easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:53.00,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Touch carelessly, and you'll \Nbe shredded to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:55.92,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,Strong wind will shut out water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.60,0:11:00.29,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,Those with no attack magic can't \Npossibly break through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:01.62,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,And I'm on my guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:04.68,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,Even a fairly skilled sorcerer would \Nfind this assignment difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:08.43,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,Not to mention you only \Nhave two elementary spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:09.91,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,Now, what would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:11.88,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What? That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.88,0:11:12.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.97,0:11:16.63,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be more challenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:22.36,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Oh? You sound unsatisfied, but let's \Nsee you complete the assignment first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.63,0:11:25.37,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Girls won't like you if you're \Nall talk and no action.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.37,0:11:27.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:28.95,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:30.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:36.21,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,A-ori? He sure produced\Na lot of them, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:40.83,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Hey now, you won't be able to break \Nthrough my Fu-ruguru with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:41.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.01,0:11:44.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:48.66,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:50.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.79,0:11:52.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:54.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:11:59.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Color!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:03.49,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Red mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:08.93,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,He's surrounded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.93,0:12:12.00,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,So I have nowhere to run. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.73,0:12:15.00,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,So? Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:16.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.97,0:12:20.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What? It is over, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.17,0:12:24.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can keep this up for at least two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:25.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:29.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,How long can you sustain a spell \Nthat requires so much magical power?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:32.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You won't last for half a day, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:35.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,There was no rule about time limit,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:38.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,so this assignment is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.91,0:12:45.17,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,It's the strength of the elementary magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:49.25,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,He made this assignment \Ninto a test of endurance,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:51.16,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,and I'm quite at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:56.25,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,If I use less magical power, \Nthe red mist will overwhelm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:13:00.17,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,Compared to intermediate magic, \Nelementary magic is easy to sustain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.89,0:13:03.17,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,And most likely he has...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:06.97,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Very well. You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:16.73,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,Who knew he'd beat me so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:20.19,main - italics,SOFF/I,0,0,0,,Zeon has sent me a child \Nwith frightening potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.19,0:13:21.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Did you see that? Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:25.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I want to try shooting super-fast \Nwater like your light beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:27.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Tell me how you do it! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.06,0:13:31.12,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,Professor Soff, it's almost \Ntime for the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:34.87,main,LOUBELLA,0,0,0,,Oh, my gosh! A sea of blood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:36.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:43.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd like to combine your light \Nmagic and my water magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.00,0:13:44.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Let's try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:45.42,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:46.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:50.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! I'll buy you a Dirashik \Nspecialty, a magic parfait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:53.01,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,You there, stop flirting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.32,0:13:55.55,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Now you'll have an individual interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.55,0:13:57.10,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Do you have any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.37,0:13:57.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.18,0:14:00.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The saint totally shuts me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.89,0:14:02.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please give her a warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.35,0:14:07.34,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,I've heard many questions in my life, \Nbut that "question" is definitely a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:09.28,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,We should send him back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:11.14,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Now, now, Ms. Sayfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.53,0:14:15.40,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Anyhow, no more flirting \Nuntil the exam is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:19.76,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Do not disturb others' peace of mind,\Nbecause this is a critical moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:20.95,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:22.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:27.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Ladies' hearts race faster \Nwhen an attractive gentleman hits on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:29.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It throws you off balance, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.55,0:14:31.51,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,We will begin the interview!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:33.46,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Hank Beat, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:34.19,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.65,0:14:42.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Professor, who will interview \Nme and about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:44.04,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:46.57,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,The topics can change, so it depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:49.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What? Like the type of ladies I like,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:51.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,or how many ladies I've \Nfallen in love with?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:55.49,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Who would ask such questions \Nto a 12-year-old?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:15:01.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,There are so many things I'd like to \Nask you about wind magic. May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.77,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Hm? Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:05.19,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Riyah Houghs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.19,0:15:06.50,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:14.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Will we be dismissed after the interview?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:15.25,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.25,0:15:17.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This isn't goodbye, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:18.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,We'll be in the same class, I hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:21.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You can tell me about light magic then!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.43,0:15:24.90,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Reyes Saint-Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:26.01,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:35.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd rather be alone with a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:37.63,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,What a coincidence. Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:39.16,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Listen, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:40.82,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,In the practical skill test,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:44.04,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,you had a next move in mind if \Nthere was a time limit, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:47.54,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I was thinking of a direct approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:51.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I was hoping I could do something with \Nerosion, fusion, and gaining control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.39,0:15:55.38,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Eroding my wind with \Nyour mist to fuse with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:59.82,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,then interfering with my magical power \Nto gain control of the wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:01.46,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:02.77,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,You thought it was possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:04.27,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,My gut said it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:09.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Gaining control of another is easier \Nfrom the inside rather than the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.43,0:16:14.08,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Magic is connected to the \Ncaster, so introduce water...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.08,0:16:16.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,or rather, let it interfere \Nwith the other's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.19,0:16:20.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Water can penetrate most materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:21.54,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:25.64,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Professor, I think water \Nis the best attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:29.16,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I wish I could say that \Nit was also the strongest,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:33.13,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but I didn't beat my master, \Nso I can't claim that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.13,0:16:38.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's why I want to study a \Nlot here, learn many things,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.05,0:16:40.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and surpass my master someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:41.91,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Wow, you surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:43.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I thought it was almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:46.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's my turn, right? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.07,0:16:47.69,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Professor, may I ask \Nyou to lead me by hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:53.19,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Not possible, because \Nyou're Zeon's student.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:02.08,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Please go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:05.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Professor Sayfie, what's on \Nthe other side of the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:07.90,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,So you really can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.45,0:17:09.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:12.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Does it lead to outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:17.77,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,No one knows for sure, but to put it \Nsimply, it's night beyond this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.11,0:17:19.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Night?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:21.12,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is there solid ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:22.63,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,You won't fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:24.37,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Are you all right by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.37,0:17:26.57,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,I can come along if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:28.04,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:29.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Night, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:33.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It is absolutely fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:44.61,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:48.49,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,My magical power can't detect anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.49,0:17:50.22,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,and my Glass Eye can't \Nsee anything, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:53.32,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It's been a while since \NI've become totally blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:57.08,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The ground is earth. I feel wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:17:59.58,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I smell dirt and grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:04.40,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,There's probably a sky \Nfull of stars above me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:05.77,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I can't see it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:08.52,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,So you're Zeonly's student?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.10,0:18:12.35,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,When did they...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:14.81,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,There are seven of them in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:17.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.67,0:18:22.84,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,That man was a prodigy, enough \Nto make me acknowledge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:24.94,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Now, what about you—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.94,0:18:27.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, please do not get too close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:28.90,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:33.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I have a fiancée, so I should \Nnot get too close to other women.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:38.07,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Didn't I see you incessantly \Nhit on the saint?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:42.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No. I just wanted to ask \Nher about magic. Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:45.07,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,And being alone with her is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.53,0:18:52.65,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Well, that aside, I'm an old \Nhag, much older than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:54.88,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Is it still an issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.19,0:19:00.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. A gentleman never changes how \Nhe treats women based on their age.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.39,0:19:05.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're a mature lady who knows \Nboth the bitter and the sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.51,0:19:08.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And I bet you're even more skilled \Nas a sorcerer than my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:11.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm already so fascinated by you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.62,0:19:13.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What if there's a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:17.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No matter how old you get, you just \Nnever know between a man and a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.29,0:19:19.40,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.22,0:19:24.94,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Have you learned anything today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:26.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.09,0:19:30.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The magic I saw was all new to me, \Nand I'd love to apply it to mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:33.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm going to try it out \Nas soon as I get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.12,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I just can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:37.11,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,How energetic you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.11,0:19:38.39,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:40.59,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,The interview is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.59,0:19:43.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It is? May I leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:47.11,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Yes. I will put you in the \Nadvanced class, like you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.11,0:19:48.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.01,0:19:51.41,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Study hard there and \Nbuild your track record.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:57.06,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,Then eventually, I, Gray Rouva, shall—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:58.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you for your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:04.23,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,That stings a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.23,0:20:11.27,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,When I told Zeonly I would teach him,\N his face lit up with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:18.75,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,No matter. Take good care of \Nthis year's trainees, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:23.93,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,I've taken in a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:25.82,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,I'm very proud of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:30.40,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,He's one in a million, and he'll \Neasily surpass you in a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:32.29,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,Not as special as me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.60,0:20:34.06,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,He hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.69,0:20:37.09,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,I know I overdid it at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.09,0:20:41.78,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,But please don't take \Nwhat I did out on my student.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:43.93,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,He's still a kid and sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.62,0:20:47.48,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,So allow him time to grow \Ninto a troublemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:51.18,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon! Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:52.98,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,How was school?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:57.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It was fun. But I missed you, Rinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.14,0:20:58.47,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.47,0:21:00.85,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I missed you so much that I had
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.85,0:21:04.01,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,three yummy parfaits while \NI was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:05.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Tell me where you went later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:07.95,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,What?! So you can go on a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:10.20,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Did you ask a girl out already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:12.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, I would never.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.01,0:21:14.08,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I only have eyes for you, Rinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:15.93,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Wow, it sounds so flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:19.09,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,You didn't ask anyone out, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:21.66,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,You didn't, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.66,0:21:24.63,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Allow him to grow into \Na troublemaker, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.63,0:21:26.34,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,Kunon Gurion...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:31.02,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,I know he will become \Nthe Cerulean Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:35.75,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,In any case, that boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.13,0:21:39.79,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,He tried to see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:46.47,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,It was still unfinished, but he used \Na spell I've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.11,0:21:49.87,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,This is why magic is so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:40.25,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE: \NTHE SAINT'S FINANCIAL PROBLEM
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.47,0:23:39.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next episode: "The Saint's \NFinancial Problem."
